36:\section{Introduction}
44:We provide a paired evaluation of a frozen open model at laptop scale. Prior work established position and length failures in larger systems \citep{liu2023lost,levy2024same} and showed that irrelevant statements can disrupt reasoning \citep{shi2023distracted}. Our main comparison moves the same answer clause while preserving the question, clause wording, codes, and filler order. We then compare a deterministic keyword filter with a query-entity selector that keeps sentences naming the company in the question. This selector comparison tests whether shortening helps when the filter does or does not retain the lexical competitor.
